{"t":"NFLX","made":"2026-11-12 00:07","name":"Netflix, Inc.","ko":"넷플릭스","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Entertainment","employees":16000,"hq":"Los Gatos, CA, United States","website":"https://www.netflix.com","summary_en":"Netflix, Inc. provides entertainment services worldwide. The company offers television (TV) series, documentaries, feature films, games, and live programming across various genres and languages. It also provides members the ability to receive streaming content through a host of internet-connected devices, including TVs, digital video players, TV set-top boxes, and mobile devices. Netflix, Inc. was incorporated in 1997 and is headquartered in Los Gatos, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Netflix, Inc.는 전 세계적으로 엔터테인먼트 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 다양한 장르와 언어에 걸쳐 텔레비전(TV) 시리즈, 다큐멘터리, 장편 영화, 게임 및 라이브 프로그래밍을 제공합니다. 또한 회원은 TV, 디지털 비디오 플레이어, TV 셋톱박스, 모바일 장치 등 인터넷에 연결된 다양한 장치를 통해 스트리밍 콘텐츠를 수신할 수 있습니다. Netflix, Inc.는 1997년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 로스가토스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":63.47,"mcap":260628512768.0,"pe":18.343931,"fpe":16.829563,"peg":1.0202,"ps":5.240383,"pb":8.899327,"ev_ebitda":16.862,"div":0.0,"beta":1.606,"hi52":116.733,"lo52":61.39},"fin":{"rev":49734631424.0,"rev_g":0.118,"eps_g":0.475,"gross":0.50685,"op":0.31296,"net":0.29691,"roe":0.53463,"fcf":25475807232.0,"cash":8222952960.0,"debt":17529788416.0,"de":59.857,"eps":3.46,"feps":3.77134},"own":{"short":0.0225,"inst":0.83338,"insider":0.0058099995},"analyst":{"n":43,"mean":84.76326,"median":82.0,"high":126.0,"low":57.0,"rec":"none","recMean":null,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":7,"buy":26,"hold":16,"sell":2,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":7,"buy":28,"hold":15,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":7,"buy":28,"hold":16,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-22","Firm":"Wolfe Research","ToGrade":"Peer Perform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"down","priceTargetAction":"","currentPriceTarget":0.0,"pri